not.  <HI REND="ITALIC">i</HI>  et VIII, 10, 1, not. sup.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et Licinio</HI>  IV.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Coss.</HI>  (315?).</P> <P COM="0116"><COL N="0116B"></COL> INTERPRETATIO.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hi qui fisci nostra commoda vel
