 <HI REND="ITALIC">injusta</HI>  et om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ab iis.</HI>  Sich. Cuj. 1—Lugd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">injusto.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fisci nomine repetunt, approbentur.</HI></P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0116" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0116">DE DIVERSIS RESCRIPTIS.</HEAD> <COL N="0117A"></COL> <P COM="0117"><NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0117" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0117C"></COL> a Ad h. c. in m. folii primi cod. 1 haec VV. literis
minutis adscripta sunt . . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni p. . . . dultum | . . . sum
