 <COL N="0145A"></COL> Hi <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0145" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0145B"></COL> a 4, Til.—Ri*.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hii.</HI></NOTE> , qui honoris indebiti arripere insignia
