recte, sed et  <HI REND="ITALIC">assistunt</HI>  defendi potest.</NOTE> , sedentibus his, quibus
emeritis omnis honor jure merito debetur. <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0145" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0145B"></COL> d Fol. 219 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0145" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0145B"></COL> b Go. in notis: « <HI REND="ITALIC">et concilium.»</HI></NOTE>  cod. 4.</NOTE>  Ideoque
sublimitas tua nullum omnino faciet praesidatus praerogativa
laetari, nisi qui cunctos in patria gradus
