VIII  <HI REND="ITALIC">Id. Jun. Sirmio</HI> <NOTE N="y" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0147" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0147D"></COL> y Be. Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sirmii.</HI></NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Gallicano et Basso Coss.</HI>  (317).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0147" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0147">DE CAESARIANIS.</HEAD> <COL N="0148A"></COL> <P COM="0148"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp.</HI> <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0148" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0148C"></COL> a Cum inscriptione h. c. incip. fol. 86 <SUP>b</SUP>  cod. 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinus A. ad Bithynos.</HI>  Caesarianos in
actu dumtaxat constitutos ad perfectissimatus vel ducenae,
vel centenae, vel egregiatus dignitates non
oportet admitti. Sed si inculpate compleverint suum
officium, et ab omni vacent ratione fiscali, judicio
datam <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0148" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0148C"></COL> b Til.—Cui. 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ratione, fiscale judicio datam.</HI></NOTE>  hujus modi dignitatem prodesse eis oportet.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  XII,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal. Aug. Gallicano et Basso Coss.</HI> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0148" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0148C"></COL> c Vid. c. 3 C. Th. de Cohort.  <CITN>(VIII, 4)</CITN> , not.</NOTE> 
(317).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0148" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0148">DE PRIMIPILARIBUS.</HEAD> <P COM="0148"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus A. ad Bithynos.</HI>  Primipilaribus
post emeritam militiam perfectissimatus, vel ducenae,
vel centenae, vel egregiatus dari dignitas potest.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI> 
XII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal. Aug. Gallicano et Basso Coss.</HI> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0148" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0148C"></COL> d Go. in Chron. p. XIII. ad hanc legem et illas,
quas supra dixi cum hac c. cohaerere, annotat: «Vel
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Licinio</HI>  hae leges tribuendae, qui Bithynia potiebatur:
vel ad alios Coss. referendae eae, et forte,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ad Gallicanum
et Symmachum,</HI>  id est, ad A. D. 330.» Si hoc
est, add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinopoli.</HI>  Vid. Vat. Fr. § 248.</NOTE>  (317).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0148" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0148">DE MURILEGULIS ET GYNAECIARIIS <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0148" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0148C"></COL> e 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">gyneceariis</HI>  et rubro col. em.  <HI REND="ITALIC">gyneceiariis. Til.</HI> 
