April. Constantino A. V. et Licinio C. Coss.</HI>  (319).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0156" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0156">DE FAMOSIS LIBELLIS.</HEAD> <COL N="0157A"></COL> <P COM="0157"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus A. ad Verinum</HI> <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0157" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0157C"></COL> a 14, 16, 38, 42  <HI REND="ITALIC">Virinum.</HI>  20, 32, 39, 43  <HI REND="ITALIC">Valerianum,</HI> 
