non mereri.</HI></NOTE>  modo volumus. § 1.
 <COL N="0164A"></COL> Sed et si quis patrimonium naviculario muneri obnoxium
possidet, licet altioris sit dignitatis, nihil ei
honoris privilegia, in hac parte duntaxat, opitulentur,
sed sive pro solido, sive pro proportione huic
muneri teneatur <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0164" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0164C"></COL> a Cui. 2—Ri <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0164" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0164D"></COL> k Be. in not. add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">in</HI>  vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">ad.</HI>  Sed vid. C. Th. VI, 26,
