huic functioni obnoxio excusato, commune
onus non omnes pro virili sustineant portione.  <HI REND="ITALIC">PP. V</HI> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0164" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0164C"></COL> b Go. in Chronol.  <HI REND="ITALIC">PP.</HI>  X,  <HI REND="ITALIC">kal.</HI></NOTE> .
