non potuerit inveniri.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat. X. Kal. Jul. Aquileia</HI> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0165" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0165C"></COL> f Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal.</HI>   <CITN>(deest Jul.)</CITN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Aquileiae.</HI>  Aur. Lugd.
