Quod si fecerit, non valebit: nam testamentum
faciendi curialibus lex ista tribuit potestatem.</HI></P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0185" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0185">DE DIVERSIS RESCRIPTIS.</HEAD> <P COM="0185"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus. A. Crepereo</HI> <NOTE N="s" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0185" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0185D"></COL> s 8, 10, 16, 18, Til. in m.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Crepereio. 5, 42 Creperio.
19 Decrepito. 27 Creperitio.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Donatiano</HI> <NOTE N="t" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0185" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0185D"></COL> t 27 om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Donatiano. 29, 42 Donatiano augg.</HI></NOTE> . Rescripta,
