meruerunt, interveniente morte, non fuerint consecuti</HI> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0186" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0186C"></COL> d Go.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gr.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">exsecuti.</HI></NOTE> ,
