errore.</NOTE> . Si quis igitur tali contractu
laborat, hac sanctione respiret <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> d 20 supr. lin.  <HI REND="ITALIC">fecerit.</HI></NOTE> , quae cum <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> e 19, 20  <HI REND="ITALIC">quecumque.</HI></NOTE> 
