hic.</NOTE>  et futura prohibet.
Creditores enim, re amissa <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> h 19  <HI REND="ITALIC">re missa.</HI></NOTE> , jubemus recipere <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> i Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">recuperare,</HI>  sed Hal.  <HI REND="ITALIC">recipere.</HI></NOTE> ,
quod dederunt.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat. pridie</HI> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> j Nonn. codd. et Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">II.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Kalend. Febr.</HI> <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> k 28, 40, Sich. in m.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Septemb.</HI>  36 om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Febr.</HI></NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Serdicae</HI> <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188C"></COL> l 21 om,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Serdicae, 28 Serdicae—Coss.</HI>  15, Sich.
