pet.  <CITN>(II, 22)</CITN> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et Constantino Caes.</HI> <NOTE N="n" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0188" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0188D"></COL> n Ita 9, 21, 24, 31; 6—8, 12, 14—17, 19  <HI REND="ITALIC">Theud. C.
Coss. 20 Thed. csul. 10 Theod. clarus cons.</HI>  et 18  <HI REND="ITALIC">Theodosius
