cautione.</HI>  Cuj. 1—Lugd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">conscriptae cautionis.</HI></NOTE> 
 <COL N="0189A"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">promittit</HI> <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0189" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0189C"></COL> a 21 in m., Sich.  <HI REND="ITALIC">permittit,</HI>  sed Sich. in m.  <HI REND="ITALIC">promittit.</HI></NOTE> :  <HI REND="ITALIC">quod factum lex ista revocat, et fieri penitus
prohibet</HI> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0189" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0189C"></COL> b Ita plerique codd.; edd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">penitus fieri pr.</HI></NOTE> :  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita ut, si quis</HI> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0189" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0189C"></COL> c 6, 7, alii  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui. 10, 18 quid.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">credito rem debitoris
sub</HI> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0189" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0189C"></COL> d 20  <HI REND="ITALIC">rem a debitore suo sub.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tali occasione visus fuerit comparare, non sibi de
