 <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantine Auguste, quo nos veteranos factos, si
nullam indulgentiam habemus?</HI>  Constantinus A. dixit:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Magis magisque conveteranis meis beatitudinem augere
debeo quam minuere.</HI>  Victorinus veteranus dixit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Muneribus
et oneribus universis locis conveniri non sinamur.</HI> 
Constantinus A. dixit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Apertius indica; quae
sunt maxime</HI> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0192" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0192C"></COL> e Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">maxima,</HI>  sed Cuj.  <HI REND="ITALIC">magnificentia,</HI> 
impr. Go.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">munera, quae vos contumaciter gravant?</HI> 
Universi veterani dixerunt:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ipse perspicis scilicet</HI> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0192" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0192C"></COL> f Cod. Just. om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">scilicet.</HI></NOTE> .
Constantinus A. dixit: Jam nunc munificentia <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0192" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0192C"></COL> g Ita ed. Be. auct. Go. ut. nos.</NOTE>  mea
 <COL N="0192B"></COL> omnibus veteranis id esse concessum perspicuum sit
