audiant, ita ut, si sententiam in reos ferendam perviderint
 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0201C"></COL> d Ita 5, recte. Schr., cj.  <HI REND="ITALIC">praeviderint.</HI>  Cl. Pu. W.
Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">providerint.</HI>  Russ. in m.  <HI REND="ITALIC">si sententia mox
reos feriendos non providerint.</HI></NOTE> , ad proconsules eos transmittere non morentur
 <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0201C"></COL> e Post. v.  <HI REND="ITALIC">morentur</HI>  omnia des. in Cod. Just.</NOTE> : ab omnibus enim judicibus hoc observari oportet,
ut, supputato tempore competenti, quo necessaria
