quod annecti allegationibus in judiciaria contentione <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0203D"></COL> m 19  <HI REND="ITALIC">jud. discussione c.</HI>  20, Sich.  <HI REND="ITALIC">cont. vel discussione
