meruerint, ne</HI> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0214" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0214C"></COL> b 6, 7, 9, 20, 42, alii  <HI REND="ITALIC">nec.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">praedia sua sine jussu judicis vel decreto,
