 <COL N="0214B"></COL> provincias <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0214" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0214C"></COL> e Fol. 360 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0214" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0214C"></COL> b 6, 7, 9, 20, 42, alii  <HI REND="ITALIC">nec.</HI></NOTE>  cod. 4.</NOTE>  diversos misimus, qui ad scientiam
