videtur Go.</NOTE> 
est, a nobis per singulos statuetur <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0231" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0231D"></COL> m Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">statuitur,</HI>  impr. Go.</NOTE> . Servos etiam,
qui hoc detulerint <NOTE N="n" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0231" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0231D"></COL> n 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui de hoc detulerit,</HI>  mendose.</NOTE> , civitate Romana donamus, ut
eorum Domini pretium a fisco percipiant <NOTE N="o" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0231" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0231D"></COL> o Cod. Just. om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Servos—percipiant,</HI>  sed conjecta
est haec sententia in c. 2 Cod. Just. Pro quib. caussis
servi  <CITN>(VII, 13)</CITN> :  <HI REND="ITALIC">Servi qui monetarios adulterinam
monetam clandestinis sceleribus exercentes in publicum
detulerint, civitate Romana donentur, ut eorum domini
 pretium a fisco percipiant,</HI>  et sq. subscr. h. c.</NOTE> . § 2. Si
quis autem militum hujus modi personam susceptam <NOTE N="p" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0231" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0231D"></COL> p Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">suspectam,</HI>  sed nostrum Go. ut legitimum
defendit.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Receptarum personarum custodia</HI>  supra
IX, 3, 5.</NOTE> 
de custodia exire fecerit, capite puniatur § 3. Appellandi
