poena capitalis excipiet.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  XII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal. Dec.</HI> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0232" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0232D"></COL> e  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  Go. habet pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">Reddita</HI>  s.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Proposita.</HI>  Cod. I.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.—Crispo et Constantino cc.</HI>  II  <HI REND="ITALIC">css.</HI>  Coll. Can. Ans.
ded.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  XII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal. Romae Crispo et Constantio Conss.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Roma,
Crispo</HI>  II.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et Constantino</HI>  II.  <HI REND="ITALIC">CC. Coss.</HI>  (321).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0232" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0232">DE JUDEIS.</HEAD> <P COM="0232"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus A. Decurionibus Agrippiensibus</HI> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0232" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0232D"></COL> f 11  <HI REND="ITALIC">Idem ad Agripiniensium.</HI>  Cuj. 2, 2*.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Agrippiniensium.</HI> 
Go. in Chron.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Agrippinensibus.</HI></NOTE> .
