 <COL N="0244A"></COL> vicesimo <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0244" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0244A"></COL> a 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vigesimo.</HI></NOTE>  et quinto  <HI REND="ITALIC">anno,</HI>  intra viginti et sex
