 <HI REND="ITALIC">et quasi minor is, priusquam tempora suppleantur,
amissam recipiat</HI> <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0250" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0250D"></COL> l 6, 7, 20, 21  <HI REND="ITALIC">recipiant.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">libertatem. Quicquid vero ille eis, a
quo empti sunt, vel tradidit vel donavit vel quacumque</HI> 
 <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0250" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0250D"></COL> m 6—9, 20, 21, 42, 44  <HI REND="ITALIC">eis ille—quaecumque.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ex rei suae administratione profecit, totum retinendi
ac revocandi habeat potestatem. Si vero hujusmodi
personis</HI> <NOTE N="n" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0250" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0250D"></COL> n 20  <HI REND="ITALIC">proficer—persona.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">aliquid a quibuscumque aliis, aut
