militum unum caput excuset <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0289" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0289D"></COL> g Go. vult.  <HI REND="ITALIC">excuset; et intra (excuseT</HI> ), sine ulla
