 <COL N="0300A"></COL> subministrant, usurpandi agminalis seu <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0300" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0300B"></COL> a Vv.  <HI REND="ITALIC">agminalis seu</HI>  des. in Cod. Just.</NOTE>  paraveredi
licentia <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0300" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0300B"></COL> b V.  <HI REND="ITALIC">licentia</HI>  videtur ab editoribus ex Cod. Just.
