Cum antehac lege de appellationibus data statutum
 <COL N="0309A"></COL> sit <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> a Go. intelligit c. 1 h. t. et c. 2 C. Th. de Appell.
 <CITN>(XI, 30)</CITN> .</NOTE> , ne quis a praejudicio vel ab exsecutione <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> b 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">excusatione,</HI>  em. a libr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">executione.</HI></NOTE>  interponeret
provocationem, neve hujus modi appellatio ab
his, qui vice <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> c 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">ce,</HI>  sed em. a libr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">vice.</HI></NOTE>  nostra judicant, admittatur ne in perniciem
 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> d Mendose Go.  <HI REND="ITALIC">principem.</HI></NOTE>  plurimorum, interpositis a praejudicio appellationibus
vel moratoriis quibusdam frustrationibus
interjectis <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> e Cuj. 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">interjectis.</HI></NOTE> , litigia protrahantur, tamen nunc poenam
addi placuit, ut intelligant universi, principalis
negotii disceptatione <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> f Edd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">disceptationes. 4. disceptationis;</HI>  a libr. em.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">disceptatione</HI>  (non  <HI REND="ITALIC">disceptationes</HI> ). Etiam Go. em.  <HI REND="ITALIC">disceptatione.</HI> 
Reposui  <HI REND="ITALIC">disceptatione.</HI>  Fortasse in litera  <HI REND="ITALIC">s</HI> 
latet v.  <HI REND="ITALIC">se,</HI>  quod apte hic interponi potest ( <HI REND="ITALIC">disceptatione
se causas</HI> ).</NOTE>  caussas suas munire debere,
et non ab ipsis quodammodo primae interlocutionis <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> g 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">interlocutionis;</HI>  a libr. add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">n</HI>  supra  <HI REND="ITALIC">is.</HI></NOTE> 
exordiis vel ab exsecutionibus provocare, cum et illis,
qui impatienter ab articulo appellandum putaverint <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> h Cum literis  <HI REND="ITALIC">verint</HI>  incip. fol. 207 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> b 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">excusatione,</HI>  em. a libr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">executione.</HI></NOTE>  cod. 4.</NOTE> ,
post cognitionem totius caussae liceat appellare, et
his, qui sero ab exsecutionibus provocant, facultas
appellandi minime fuerit denegata. Si quis igitur tali
usus appellatione fuerit in tuo judicio deprehensus,
 <COL N="0309B"></COL> ipsum quidem triginta folium poena mulctes, causam
autem universam, ejus duntaxat, qui <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309C"></COL> i Go. ann.:  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui duntaxat,</HI>  quo non opus est. Sustuli
 <COL N="0309D"></COL> uncos, quibus Be. vv.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ejus—appellaverit</HI>  incluserat.</NOTE>  a praejudicio
vel ab executione temere appellaverit, sine ulla dilatione
discingas <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309D"></COL> j 4, Til.—Lugd  <HI REND="ITALIC">discinguas.</HI></NOTE> , cum in <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309D"></COL> k Aur. Ludg.
om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">in.</HI></NOTE>  nostro auditorio dari minime
dilationem oporteat, interpositae appellationis
tempore sufficiente litigatoribus ad perferendam instructionem
plenissimam <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0309" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0309D"></COL> l Summ. C. Th. aliquid add., quod in h. c. deest.
Ita enim habent:  <HI REND="ITALIC">«Superiori similis, sed hoc hic additum
