 <COL N="0316A"></COL> Quae tyrannus <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0316" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0316C"></COL> a Go. in comm. probat hanc c. neque a Constantio
datam esse, neque de Maxentio tyranno agere:
