pendente inquietari describique fas non sit <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0327" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0327C"></COL> a Fol. 79 <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0326" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0326B"></COL> a 28, 30, 36, 40  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  X. 31  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  XII. 8 om. XI
et mox VII. Go.:  <HI REND="ITALIC">«al.</HI>  V.»</NOTE>  cod. 4.</NOTE> . Ubi
ergo controversia exstiterit, fisco alicujus patrimonium
vindicante, apud eum omnibus facultatibus
constitutis cognitio ventiletur, ut, cum rei exitus
debere eas vindicari <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0327" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0327D"></COL> b Ita recte Be. ex Cod. Just.; 4, edd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">vindicare.</HI> 
Stare posse  <HI REND="ITALIC">vindicare</HI>  Go. dicit.</NOTE>  probaverit, tum demum res
persequi liccat, et super modo facultatum ac rerum
interrogationem haberi <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0327" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0327D"></COL> c Ri*. mendose  <HI REND="ITALIC">habere.</HI></NOTE> , quae per conditionales servos
