distrahantur, et qui emptione dominium nacti fuerint,
inspiciendum <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0328" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0328C"></COL> h Go. Be. excidisse putant V.  <HI REND="ITALIC">censum</HI>  occasione
