regulam <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331C"></COL> j Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ultrae temporis definitionem.</HI></NOTE>  proferat. Qua dilatione, si <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331C"></COL> k 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">et si.</HI></NOTE>  a
possessore <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> l Cod Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">a reo.</HI>  Cf. Dirksen l. c. p. 402.</NOTE>  impetratur, etiam octor <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> m 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">impetretur et jam petitor.</HI></NOTE>  in requirendis
probationibus ut minime prohibetur <NOTE N="n" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> n Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">prohibebitur.</HI></NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  XIV.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal.
Aug. PP.</HI> <NOTE N="o" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> o Cod. Just. om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">PP.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Romae</HI> <NOTE N="p" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> p 15 add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ad Senatum</HI>  et 27  <HI REND="ITALIC">a senatu.</HI></NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantino Caes.</HI>  V.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et Maximo</HI> <NOTE N="q" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> q 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantio et M.</HI>  et pm.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Caes.</HI>  V.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Coss.</HI>  (327.)</P> <P COM="0331"><COL N="0331B"></COL> INTERPRETATIO.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Licet</HI> <NOTE N="r" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> r 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">Liquet.</HI>  Go. reponi vult:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Licet constitutum sit,
ut petentibus quatuor mensium.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">quatuor mensibus constitutum</HI> <NOTE N="s" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> s Ita 15, 27, 28, sed 40, 41 et edd. add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">sit,</HI> 
quod sensum pervertit.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ut petentibus pro requirendo omni restitutione</HI> <NOTE N="t" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> t 40, 41 Sich. Cuj. Aur. Lugd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">instructione.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">induciae concedantur. Unde si illud spatium requiratur,
quod indultum est, id est, quod quatuor menses non
possit excedere, praestari convenit</HI> <NOTE N="u" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> u 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">conveniet.</HI></NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Si vero tales petantur
iuddciae, quae tempus lege constitutum excedant,
petitori debet dilatio negari, quia</HI> <NOTE N="v" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> v 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">denegari qui.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">scire debuit actionem
suam constituto tempore finiendam. Quod si ille
spatium, qui rem possidet, fortasse petierit, dari sine
mora temporis, quod petentibus datum est, omnino
debet</HI> <NOTE N="x" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> x 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">debebit.</HI></NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia scire non potuit, quando ab adversario
provocaretur ad causam, et ideo</HI> <NOTE N="y" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> y 40, 41, Sich. om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ab.—ideo.</HI>  15 add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">quando.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">possessor spatium,
ut respondere possit, accipiat. Petitor etiam suis partibus
necessaria poterit providere</HI> <NOTE N="z" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331D"></COL> z 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">possit spatium accepit etiam petitor. s. p. poterit
necessaria providere.</HI></NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0331"><COL N="0331C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinus A. ad Victori Rationali urbis Romae.</HI> Quoniam nonnulli fisci debitores, cum jussi fuerint
