 <COL N="0332C"></COL> preces.</NOTE> , placuit, <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> b Fol. 185 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0331" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0331C"></COL> b 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">conf. praedicti temp. petuntur</HI>  et om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et.</HI></NOTE>  cod. 4.</NOTE>  ut, si intra <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> c In summ. C. Th. add. XX.</NOTE>  dies complendis <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> d Codd. Just. om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">complendis.</HI></NOTE> 
solennitatibus praestitutos ad facienda haec appellatoris
cura defuerit, deserta ab eo provocatio aestimetur
