Constantino</HI> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> f 4 Til.—Ri*. Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantio.</HI>  Vid. supra XI,
7, 4, not.  <HI REND="ITALIC">u.</HI>  Mox. Aur. Lngd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Const.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et Maximo Coss.</HI>  (327.)</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0332" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0332">DE RESP. PRUD.</HEAD> <P COM="0332"><HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinus A. ad Maximum Ps. P.</HI> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> g Dicit Cl. p. 128, not. 21, hujus anni Maximum
praefectum praetorio nusquam inveniri. Anno seq.
exstare constitutionem Maximo cuidam, sed sine dignitate
inscriptam, quem Go. PP. Galliarum fuisse
autumet. Vid. c. 5 C. Th. de Veteranis  <CITN>(VII, 20)</CITN> .—Commemoratur
etiam  <HI REND="ITALIC">Maximus Ps. P.</HI>  in c. 2 C. Th.
de Off. Praef. praet.  <CITN>(1, 5)</CITN> , quamobrem dubitari non
posse existimo, quin Pf. Praetorio fuerit.</NOTE> . Universa <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> h 5  <HI REND="ITALIC">Inuisa.</HI></NOTE> ,
quae scriptura Pauli continentur, recepta auctoritate
firmanda sunt et omni veneratione celebranda. Ideoque
Sententiarum libros, plenissima luce et perfectissima
elocutione et jutissima juris ratione succinctos,
in judiciis prolatos valere, minime dubitatur.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI> <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> i Cl. l. c. not. 22 explicat per  <HI REND="ITALIC">Reddita,</HI>  cum Constantinus
h. anno in Gallia non fuerit, coll. Go. in.
Chronol. ann. 325, 328, 331, 389, ibique citt. constitt.
Secutus est Cl. in hac re Go. ad. c. 5 C. Th. cit.
 <COL N="0332D"></COL> <CITN>(T. II. p. 438 not. <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0332" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0332C"></COL> h 5 Inuisa.</NOTE> )</CITN> , qui, quamquam  <HI REND="ITALIC">Trevirim</HI>  in
Gallia accipit, fortasse locum in Triballis et in Dacia,
ubi Constantinus hoc tempore egit, indicari existimat.</NOTE> 
