 <COL N="0365B"></COL> (331).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0365" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0365">DE JURISDICTIONE OMNIUM JUDICUM.</HEAD> <P COM="0365"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constant. A. ad universos provinciales.</HI>  Nemo
