offensa, perdiderit <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371C"></COL> e 1 . . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">diderint, 9 perdiderint. 19 praerogativa—perdiderint.</HI> 
W. monuit, pluralem hunc in licum non
quadrare; tamen quadrat, si legitur:  <HI REND="ITALIC">possessiones—perdiderint,</HI> 
quemadmodum initio legis dicitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">possessiones—avelluntur.</HI></NOTE> ,
tantum de facultatibus propriis,
censura imminente, minoribus restituat, quanto <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371C"></COL> f Ita 1, 6, 7, 14, 16, 17, Til. P. Pu. W. Edd.
Sich. Cuj. 1—Be.  <HI REND="ITALIC">quantum.</HI></NOTE> 
rem valere potuisse constabit <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371C"></COL> g 1, 14,  <HI REND="ITALIC">constavit.</HI>  Tota const. in Cod. Just. ita depravata
est:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Si tutoris vel curatoris culpa vel dolo, eo
