parentes eorum habere meruerant, sub qualibet praestatione
tenuerint, et hoc per negligentiam sive proditionem <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> l 6  <HI REND="ITALIC">proditione.</HI></NOTE> 
tutoris</HI> <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> m 42 inter lin. add.  <HI REND="ITALIC">procuratoris.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">aut imminutum fuerit aut certe sublatum,
quicquid perierit, a tutore vel curatore</HI> <NOTE N="n" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> n 42 supra lin  <HI REND="ITALIC">procuratore.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">esse reddendum.</HI></P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0371" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0371">DE DONATIONIBUS.</HEAD> <COL N="0371B"></COL> <P COM="0371"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus A. ad Severum Comitem Hispaniarum.</HI> Data jam pridem lege statuimus <NOTE N="o" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> o Go.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Legem,</HI>  err. typ. Go. dubitat, utrum intelligenda
sit c. 1 an c. 3 h. t., etsi potius hanc intelligi
opinatur. Equidem puto c. 1 significari, ad quam cum
prior sit, imperator ipse provocat in c. 3 h. t.</NOTE> , ut donationes
interveniente actorum testificatione confiteantur <NOTE N="p" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> p Cf. Dirksen l. c. p. 483.</NOTE> .
Quod vel maxime inter necessarias conjunctissimasque <NOTE N="q" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> q Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">conjunctasque.</HI></NOTE> 
personas convenit custodiri, siquidem clandestinis
ac domesticis fraudibus facile quidvis pro negotii
opportunitate confingi potest, vel id quod vere gestum
est, aboleri. Cum igitur ne <NOTE N="r" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> r Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">nec.</HI></NOTE>  liberos quidem ac parentes
ex nostra ab actorum confectione secernat, id,
quod necessario super donationibus apud acta conficiendis
jam pridem statuimus, universos teneat <NOTE N="s" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> s Seqq. des. in Cod. Just., pro quibus extrema c. 8
 <COL N="0372B"></COL> h. t. pars eo translata est:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Gesta autem confici super
rebus etiam alibi collatis, ubicunque sufficit.</HI></NOTE> ,
 <COL N="0372A"></COL> salvo tamen juris privilegio, quod liberis et parentibus
suffragatur, scilicet ne traditionis vel mancipationis <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0372" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0372B"></COL> a Cuj. 1, Cuj. 2, 2*  <HI REND="ITALIC">mancipantionis.</HI></NOTE> 
solemnitas sit necessaria.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat.</HI>  IV <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0372" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0372B"></COL> b Cod. Just.  <HI REND="ITALIC">III.</HI>  impr. Ri.</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Non.
