annonarios et actuarios conditionales esse
 <COL N="0373A"></COL> praecepimus <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> a Ita Go. ex codice; rell.  <HI REND="ITALIC">praecipimus.</HI></NOTE> , annonis etiam adjuvari <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> b Go. mendose  <HI REND="ITALIC">adjuvari.</HI></NOTE> , et capitationem
eorum, qui censiti <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> c Codex et edd. ante Be.  <HI REND="ITALIC">censeti.</HI>  Hoc etiam paullo
infra. Be auct. Go. em.  <HI REND="ITALIC">censiti.</HI></NOTE>  sunt, haberi immunem.
Ideoque tua solertia competentia monebit <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> d Cuj. 1. Cuj. 2, 2*  <HI REND="ITALIC">amonebit,</HI>  errore propter antecedentem
literam  <HI REND="ITALIC">a.</HI>  Aur. Lugd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">admonebit.</HI>  Go. ex
cod. rest.  <HI REND="ITALIC">monebit,</HI>  quod Ri. Ri*. Be. rec.</NOTE>  officia,
ut actuariis binas annonas, annonariis vero singulas
protinus subministrent, capitationem quoque, ipsorum
tantum, qui ex his censiti sunt, faciat <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> e Ne conjicias  <HI REND="ITALIC">faciant.</HI></NOTE>  haberi
immunem, quod in actu fuerint constituti: nam postea
vel laus eos et dignitas honorabit, vel, si in culpa
fuerint deprehensi, poena comitabitur.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Emissa</HI>  III.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Non. Maii, Dalmatio et Zenophilo</HI> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> f Codex, Cuj. 1—Lugd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Zenofilo.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Coss.</HI>  (333).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0373" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0373">DE MEDICIS ET PROFESSORIBUS.</HEAD> <P COM="0373"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus A. ad Populum.</HI>  Beneficia divorum
retro principium confirmantes, medicos et professores
litterarum, uxores etiam et filios eorum ab omni functione
et ab omnibus muneribus publicis vacare praecipimus,
 <COL N="0373B"></COL> nec ad militiam comprehendi, neque hospites
recipere, nec ullo fungi munere, quo facilius liberalibus
studiis et memoratis artibus multos instituant.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">PP.</HI>  V.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal. Oct., Constantinopoli, Dalmatio et Zenophilo</HI> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> g 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">Zenofilio</HI>  et Aur. Lugd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Cons.</HI></NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Coss.</HI>  (333).</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0373" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0373">DE DIVERSIS RESPECTIS.</HEAD> <P COM="0373"><HI REND="ITALIC">Imp. Constantinus ad Barbarum P. A.</HI> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0373" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0373C"></COL> h Ri*  <HI REND="ITALIC">Rarbarum</HI>  mendose. Cod. Just. om.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Barbarum.</HI> 
