om. etc.</NOTE>  etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dat. XII.</HI> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> e c. IV. Sirm., 9, 16, 30, 44  <HI REND="ITALIC">XIII;</HI>  rell.  <HI REND="ITALIC">XI.</HI>  Innonn.
