fevrontaû taú prospivptonta× tauvthn gaúr uJperfuwðû
 <COL N="0442B"></COL> ejxocwtavthn ijscuún eiønai diebebaiouðto, sterjrJovthta
diagr_noivaû metaú filosofivaû håtiû ejstiú touð ajlhqouðû kaiú touð
