prostivqhsin oJ poihthúû×</FOREIGN> 

 <POEM COM="0455"><L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Toún deú newstiv pw tecqevnta faesfovre mhvnh,</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Antiú sidhreivhû crushðn genehún ojpavsanta,</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Proskuvnei.</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Touðde gaúr aærcontoû, menoeikeva pavnta brovteia.</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kaiú stonacaiv te kateunavzontai ajlitrwðn.</FOREIGN></L></POEM> 

