 <POEM COM="0459"><L><COL N="0459C"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Pauðra d1 oåmwû iæcnh protevraû perileivpetai aæthû.</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Povnton ejpaiðxai, periú t1 aæstea teivcesi kleiðsai,</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Rhxaiv t1 eijlipovdwn eJlkuvsmasi tevlson ajrouvrhû×</FOREIGN></L> <L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Alloû eæpoi t1 eæstai Tivfuû, kaiú qessaliúû 3Argw,
1Andravsin hJrwvessin ajgallomevnh× polevmou dev
Trwvwn kaiú Danawðn peirhvsetai auøqiû 1Acilleuúû.</FOREIGN></L></POEM> 

 <COL N="0462A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>euøg1 wø sofwvtate poihtaú× thún gavr poihtikhún ejxousivan,
