2Rwvmhé, thlikouvtoiû ejpicaivronteû dhmosivoiû kakoiðû× pareskeuvasto
deú kaiú pedivon thð mavché. suú deú proelqouðsa,
ejpevdwkaû eJauthún ejpereidomevnhn thðé proúû Qeoún pivstei.
 <COL N="0467A"></COL> qnhtwðn (deú) dussebwðn wjmovthû, divkhn puroúû ajkatavpaustoû
ejpinemhsamevnh, qaumasthún kaiú diaú pantoúû ajoivdimon eujdoxivan
proshðyev soi. sevbaû gaúr diaú tauðta eiøce touúû qewmevnouû
