kaiú diwkovmenon kaiú ejpibouleuovmenon ejqavlyate
taiðû pistotavtaiû eJautwðn yucaiðû kaiú dianoivaiû. ejmeú deú
hædh eujfraivnei ejnnoouvmenon kaiú proorwðnta twðé logismwðé thún
 <COL N="0911B"></COL> ejpiú thðé ejpanovdwé eJkavstou uJmwðn caraún, kaiú touð plhvqouû
taúû qeosebestavtaû ajpanthvseiû, kaiú toú eændoxon thðû twðn
