 <COL N="0935A"></COL> Eij deú thðé grafhðé suvnhqeû, kaiú toú oålon qeologeiðn, kaiú toú oålon
ajnqrwtologeiðn, eJpwvmeqa kaiú hJmeiðû twiðû qeivoiû rJhvmasi, kaiú
