ejstiú mhv ajqrovon</FOREIGN>   <CITN>(al.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajqwéon</FOREIGN> )</CITN>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toún toiouðton katakrivnesqai,
